#: ../../../source/sms.rst:5
msgid ""
"The SMS API supports two sending modes: template SMS and freeform SMS. "
"Template SMS is the default for standard accounts, while freeform SMS is "
"available only to approved trusted partners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sms.rst:7
msgid ""
"Template SMS uses approved message templates with validated variables. "
"Freeform SMS allows a fully custom message body, but access is "
"restricted."
msgstr ""

